@startuml 009-before
' D 도메인: 게임 결과 메시지 리팩토링 전 (refactor/base 881819f, #60)
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

package "ui (D)" {
  class LifeFrame <<JFrame>> {
    + LifeFrame(Cell, GameController, Clock)
  }
  interface UserDialogs <<Strategy>> {
    + chooseFile(selectButtonText : String) : File
    + showError(message : String)
  }
  class SwingUserDialogs
  class GameMenu
  class BoardPanel
}

package "application (B)" {
  class GameController {
    + addGameListener(GameListener)
    + gameResultMessage() : String
  }
  interface GameListener <<Observer>> {
    + boardChanged(Change)
  }
}

package "javax.swing" {
  class JOptionPane
  class SwingUtilities
}

UserDialogs <|.. SwingUserDialogs
GameMenu ..> UserDialogs : Load/Store 오류
SwingUserDialogs ..> JOptionPane
LifeFrame ..> GameController : addGameListener(람다)
LifeFrame ..> JOptionPane : GAME_OVER 결과 창
LifeFrame ..> SwingUtilities : invokeLater
GameController --> GameListener
BoardPanel ..|> GameListener : (람다로 구독)

note right of LifeFrame
  생성자 안의 람다가 GAME_OVER를 받아
  JOptionPane을 직접 띄운다.
  창이 있어야 생성 가능 → 테스트 없음.
end note
@enduml
